'''Super Gluttony''' is a [[mini-boss]] and one of the [[Seven Deadly Sins#Super Sins|Seven Super Deadly Sins]]. He is randomly encountered as an alternate version of {{E|Gluttony}}.

== Behavior ==
Super Gluttony wanders randomly around the room and performs one of two attacks:
* Fires 8 projectiles in all directions in conjunction with a disorganized spray of projectiles aimed at Isaac, similar to {{E|Monstro}}.
* Fires a {{i|Brimstone}} laser out of his belly and back towards Isaac if he is aligned in a cardinal direction.
Super Gluttony deals a whole heart of contact damage.

== Notes ==
* Super Gluttony can spawn with 2 {{E|Vis}} in the mini-boss room.
* {{dlc|nr}} Super Gluttony can drop {{i|Bucket of Lard}} even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it. 

== Trivia ==
* Similar to {{E|Gluttony}}, who is a {{E|Vis}} with a head, Super Gluttony is a {{E|Double Vis}} with a head.
* The [[wikipedia:Seven Deadly Sins|Seven Deadly Sins]] that these mini-bosses are based upon are, in Christian teachings, a classification of vices from which all others are derived.

